// case: services/c4010_extern_named
// clause: SPEC-04 LS-323 to LS-328; SPEC-04 LS-323, LS-201
// subset: cint-core-1 (an extern named without a call)
// entry: run; args: none
// spec outcome: compile error C4010 at 10:13, the name `clock` in `I64 x = clock;`: a function or extern name is not a value

